# The core library has NO runtime dependencies and needs NO keys.
# Only the demo app (demo/) runs an agent.
#
# To run the demo:  echo 'ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...' > .env  →  npm install  →  npm run demo
#
# The demo drives a REAL Claude Code agent via the Claude Agent SDK. Triolima
# governs it from inside the harness's own hooks (on-device). The key is read
# server-side only and never reaches the browser. Use your own key.

ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Optional — the model the agent runs on. Accepts an alias (haiku / sonnet / opus)
# or a full id. Default: haiku (cheapest).
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=haiku

# Optional — the port the demo serves on. Default: 5173.
# PORT=5173
